    <summary>
            Extension methods for <see cref="T:Azure.AI.AgentServer.Core.AgentHostBuilder" /> that register the Activity protocol
            on the Foundry Core host builder. It composes the Activity protocol onto a host built with
            <see cref="M:Azure.AI.AgentServer.Core.AgentHost.CreateBuilder(System.String[])" />, giving you full control over service
            registration, configuration, and tracing while still leveraging the Core framework
            infrastructure (OpenTelemetry, health probes, middleware).
            </summary>
